                "message": "Fix sp-notes-create with a nil vulpea directory; make move-region create notes with sp-notes-create\n\n- sp-notes-create passed a nil vulpea-default-notes-directory to vulpea.\n  It now falls back to sp-notes-filing-root (sp-notes-create-base).\n- sp-move-region-to-heading no longer requires denote; sp-tab-inbox and\n  sp-tab-psearch load again.\n- init.el no longer requires the merged sp-notes-filing module.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNi9hnWskPJso94gsTkL",
